  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "SRT dissector: Fixed failure code presentation in the handshake",
  "description": "The srt.hs.reqtype field is used in SRT also to report a connection failure code when the connection is rejected. The dissector was displaying this value incorrectly as \"Unknown\". SRT was changed in the meantime and now values over 1000 define a rejection code. This fix could be done better and enclose the full list of the failure symbol names at least for the SRT internal rejection codes, but it requires more time.",
